WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
This is a review of every base in the unit.

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:04.920
Port, carry.

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.520
Tract, pull.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.940
Struct, build.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.490
Spect, look.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.210
Ject, throw.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.810
Script, write.

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.410
Rupt, break.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.960
Duct, lead.

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.270
Form, shape.

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.330
You know a lot of Latin now.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:25.230
Take a long word apart, and it will tell you what it means.
